9.029l-4.916 4.819 17.466 4.33-3.521-9.155zM132.24 0l9.268 36.385-9.268 29.357h-19.931L86.526 47.997zM88.273 81.665h9.042l4.916 4.825-17.486 4.338 3.528-9.17zm-9.507 42.305 2.06-7.542-4.146-4.618H64.82l-4.145 4.618 2.059 7.542"></path><path fill="#c0c4cd" d="M78.766 123.969v12.453H62.735v-12.453z"></path><path fill="#e7ebf6" d="m39.742 122.662 23.006 13.754v-12.453l-2.06-7.541zm62.031 0-23.007 13.754v-12.453l2.06-7.541z"></path></svg><div class="skewing-title-heading_heading__vdwkz" style="--color:var(--consumer-purple-light);--color-primary:var(--consumer-green-dark);--color-secondary:var(--consumer-purple-light);--perspective:800px"><div class="skewing-title-heading_track__Ra4mF type-display-xl skewing-title-heading_skewing-supported__T0kQR"><h2 class="skewing-title-heading_title__SSdcP skewing-title-heading_title-regular__k38_u font-mm-poly-variable" style="--variable-font-wdth:25;--variable-font-reso:5">Get <br>MetaMask</h2><canvas class="font-mm-poly-variable" style="--variable-font-wdth:25;--variable-font-reso:5"></canvas></div></div><div class="skewing-title_button-container__C3HFw"><a href="https://link.metamask.io/rewards?sig_params=&amp;sig=KfJAXuTfD969tLrVTvDCM7-1FPo40fi4hIKKa_BPcHGE4gS1MOyyVrRRs5ERjIlR_eLxh3Tql-8oI9aH0lEHIQ" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" class="button_button__XszAu text-decoration-none button_secondary__dL8o7 button_is-large__gpGnR" aria-label="Get Started" style="--button-color-hover:var(--color-secondary);--button-text-color-hover:var(--color-primary)"><span class="button_button-holder__kUpTr"><span class="button_button-main__TuB1C"><span class="button_label__93kOT font-primary font-weight-medium">GET STARTED</span></span><span class="button_button-hover__i85n6" aria-hidden="true"><span class="button_label__93kOT font-primary font-weight-medium">GET STARTED</span></span></span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-block_faq-block__Ikcqt" style="--color:var(--consumer-purple-light);--color-primary:var(--consumer-green-dark);--color-secondary:var(--consumer-purple-light)" id="frequently-asked-questions"><div class="faq-block_container__0PPNs container"><div class="faq-block_holder__xY70x"><div class="faq-block_text__cpyLK"><h2 class="heading_heading__zJ45d font-mm-sans type-heading-ml"><span>Frequently Asked Questions</span><span class="heading_anchor-container__kztuO"><a href="#frequently-asked-questions" class="heading_anchor__1acN7" aria-label="Direct link to Frequently Asked Questions"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M0 0h24v24H0Zm19 24 5-5v5zm-5.062-12.95h-3.873l-5.068 5.067v2.874h2.874l2.51-2.51 1.414 1.413-3.096 3.095H3v-5.7l6.238-6.238h4.701zM21 8.7l-6.24 6.239h-4.7V12.94h3.874L19 7.872V5h-2.874l-2.51 2.51-1.414-1.413L15.298 3h5.701zM5 0 0 5V0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></span></h2></div><div class="faq-block_accordion-holder__c1cMM"><div style="--color:var(--consumer-purple-light);--color-primary:var(--consumer-green-dark);--color-secondary:var(--consumer-purple-light)"><ul class="accordion_list__mXtyU"><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">What is the MetaMask Rewards program?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">MetaMask Rewards is the official crypto rewards and loyalty program built into MetaMask’s self-custodial wallet. With MetaMask Rewards, you earn real world value every time you trade perps or swap tokens through MetaMask mobile app and extension. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How does MetaMask Rewards work?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">As soon as you opt-in to MetaMask Rewards, you&#x27;ll receive points for trading perps or swapping tokens through MetaMask. </p><p class="richtext-p">Monitor your points and track your progress through each level, with the MetaMask Rewards dashboard on MetaMask mobile app. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">What benefits can I receive from MetaMask Rewards in Season 1?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Trade perps and swap tokens through MetaMask to earn onchain and IRL rewards like: </p><ul class="richtext-ul"><li><p class="richtext-p">A cut of over $30 million in $LINEA</p></li><li><p class="richtext-p">Trading fee discounts </p></li><li><p class="richtext-p">Future token allocations</p></li><li><p class="richtext-p">Exclusive offers </p></li></ul><p class="richtext-p"></p><p class="richtext-p">Stay tuned for more MetaMask Rewards perks being announced soon...</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How many MetaMask Rewards points can I earn?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">There is no upper limit to the maximum amount of MetaMask Rewards points you can earn through swaps and trades. The more points you earn, the more $LINEA you will qualify for. Each season, your total progress will reset. Your trading activity from the previous season will be reflected through bonuses you&#x27;ll receive at the start of the new season.</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">If I reach the highest level of MetaMask Rewards, will my points be capped?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">No, you will continue to receive rewards based on the total points you earn. There is no upper limit to the maximum amount of MetaMask Rewards points you can earn through swaps and trades. The more points you earn, the more $LINEA you will qualify for. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How do I redeem MetaMask Rewards points?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">After you opt-in to MetaMask Rewards, you’ll automatically receive points for every eligible trade that you make. To view and claim your MetaMask Rewards: </p><p class="richtext-p">1. Tap the <b class="richtext-b">Rewards</b> tab on your MetaMask mobile app.</p><p class="richtext-p">2. Tap <b class="richtext-b">Levels</b> to view the list of your unlocked rewards.</p><p class="richtext-p">3. Claim available rewards, and track your progress. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">What crypto loyalty programs are there?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Crypto loyalty programs for traders include MetaMask Rewards, Binance Rewards, Trust Wallet Earn, and OKX Wallet incentives. MetaMask Rewards is crypto&#x27;s leading loyalty program, featuring exclusive token drops and perks.</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How many MetaMask Rewards points can I receive?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">There is no limit on the maximum amount of MetaMask Rewards points you can receive when you trade crypto on MetaMask during Season 1. After each season, your progress will reset. Remember: your trading activity from the previous season will earn bonuses that you&#x27;ll receive at the start of the subsequent season.</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Does MetaMask have a rewards program?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Yes! MetaMask Rewards is the only official rewards and crypto loyalty program for the MetaMask self-custodial wallet. To start earning MetaMask Rewards points today, update your MetaMask mobile app on iOS or Android to version 7.57 or higher, and opt-in via the Rewards tab in the app. Make sure to add all the accounts you use for trading to the Rewards program to maximize your total points. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">What are the eligibility requirements for joining MetaMask Rewards program?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">To join MetaMask Rewards, all you need to do is update your MetaMask mobile app on iOS or Android to version 7.57 or higher. Open your MetaMask app, and tap the <b class="richtext-b">Rewards</b> tab at the bottom of your screen to get started. Once you opt-in, you&#x27;ll automatically receive points for all eligible transactions—like trading perps or swapping tokens. </p><p class="richtext-p">MetaMask Rewards is currently unavailable in the United Kingdom, and in any other regions where MetaMask services are not supported.</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Does MetaMask Rewards offer a sign-up bonus?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Yes! You’ll receive 250 bonus points when you sign-up today (subject to eligibility).</p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Does MetaMask Rewards offer referral bonuses or finder fees?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Yes! If you refer a friend to MetaMask Rewards, and they successfully use your code when signing-up, they’ll receive an additional 250 bonus points for a total sign-up bonus of 500 points, and you’ll receive 10 points every time they earn 50 points from trading. Win win. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How can I refer others to MetaMask Rewards?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Tap on the referrals icon at the top of the Rewards section on MetaMask mobile. From here, you can find your referral code and link. When someone signs up for MetaMask Rewards using your referral code, they will earn 250 additional points for a total sign-up bonus of 500 points, and you’ll receive 10 points for every 50 points they earn from trading. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Where can I see how many MetaMask Rewards points I have?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Check out your MetaMask Rewards points at any time by opening MetaMask mobile app and tapping on the <b class="richtext-b">Rewards</b> tab at the bottom of your screen. This is where you’ll find your total points, progress towards the next reward level, any active boosts, and additional details about your rewards. </p><p class="richtext-p">To get a full breakdown of your points history, including trades and referrals, go to the <b class="richtext-b">Activity</b> tab within the Rewards section on MetaMask Mobile. This is where you’ll find a list of all actions that have earned you points. You can tap any entry for more information about each transaction. Note: points may take up to one hour to show up in the Activity tab after a trade. </p><p class="richtext-p">
To get a breakdown of how many referrals you have and how many points you’ve earned from referrals, go to the <b class="richtext-b">Referrals </b>page by tapping the icon at the top of the Rewards section on MetaMask Mobile. Here you can also find your referral code and link to share with others. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">What are MetaMask Rewards boosts?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Boosts are multipliers that increase the number of points you earn for specific trades or activities in MetaMask Rewards. For example, swaps made on the Linea network earn double points thanks to a 2x boost. Some boosts apply to all users for a limited time, while others unlock as you reach higher reward levels.</p><p class="richtext-p">
You can check for active boosts by going to the <b class="richtext-b">Rewards</b> tab in the MetaMask mobile app, where any boosts affecting your account will be displayed. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Can boosts be combined?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Yes, you can earn additional points in a single trade from multiple boosts. For example, if a 100% boost is active for swaps on Linea, and another 50% boost is active for swaps made using the mobile app, those can be combined for a total 150% boost, a 2.5x multiplier. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">I’ve been using MetaMask for years. Will I get points for swaps and bridges I did in the past? </span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Yes! You will earn a loyalty bonus for each account you add to your MetaMask Rewards profile with at least $1,250 USD of historical swaps and bridging volume. Loyalty bonuses are awarded in increments of 250 for each $1,250 of past volume, up to a total of 50,000 points. When you add an account that qualifies for a loyalty bonus, the bonus will appear within a couple hours in the <b class="richtext-b">Activity </b>tab of the Rewards section on MetaMask Mobile. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">How can I add more accounts to my Rewards profile? </span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Tap the settings icon at the top of the Rewards section of MetaMask Mobile to go to the <b class="richtext-b">Settings</b> page. From here, you can add more accounts to your Rewards profile. Add as many trading accounts as you have to aggregate your activity and earn more points! Note: Hardware wallet accounts are not supported yet. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Why is Rewards asking for permission to track my activity?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">In order to calculate your points, MetaMask Rewards tracks your trading activity on each account that you add to the program. We do not share this data with third parties, and we never sell your data. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">I joined MetaMask Rewards but I no longer wish to participate. Can I opt out? </span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">You can opt out of MetaMask Rewards at any time by tapping the settings icon at the top of the Rewards section of MetaMask Mobile to go to the <b class="richtext-b">Settings </b>page. At the bottom of this page, you’ll find the option to opt out of the program. Note: opting out will erase your progress. If you rejoin the program at a later date, you’ll start back at level 1. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Have more questions about MetaMask Rewards?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Need extra help using MetaMask Rewards? We got you. Visit the MetaMask Rewards Support hub <a href="https://support.metamask.io/manage-crypto/metamask-rewards" target="_blank" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" class="richtext-a" rel="noopener">here</a>. Check out additional FAQs, explore available countries, dive into detailed guides, and get assistance in your local language. </p></div></div></li><li class="accordion_item__LH9Fw"><button class="accordion_header__Q5b_W" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><span class="accordion_item-title__vS_fV font-weight-medium">Why am I reaching a 404 when I scan the page QR code to join MetaMask Rewards?</span><span class="accordion_button__wGkXi"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space="preserve" width="11" height="10" viewBox="0 0 11 10"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4.2 0h1.5v10H4.2z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 4.2h10v1.5H0z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="accordion_text__LDWPM type-paragraph-m" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">To join MetaMask Rewards, make sure you&#x27;re using the latest version of MetaMask mobile. Getting started is easy. Just update MetaMask mobile app on iOS or Android to version 7.57 or higher.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="faq-block_disclaimer__wsKRe"><div class="prominent-disclaimer_prominent-disclaimer__S2TLI"><div class="prominent-disclaimer_title__j9gkU type-heading-s font-mm-sans">Disclaimer</div><div class="prominent-disclaimer_disclaimer-text__BhZ0H type-paragraph-m"><div class="contentful-rich-text-styles"><p class="richtext-p">Any Linea token payout will be based on a set of activities. This estimate is based on our projection of those activities and the current price of the Linea token, both of which are subject to change.</p><p class="richtext-p">MetaMask Rewards does not constitute an offer, recommendation, or solicitation to engage with digital assets, nor does it provide advice in any form. It is not intended for jurisdictions where such participation would violate laws or regulations. Participants must ensure compliance with applicable restrictions. Digital assets are speculative, volatile, and high-risk, with the potential for complete loss of value.</p><p class="richtext-p">The value of digital assets, including rewards, may fluctuate significantly. Rewards earned may differ in value at the time of distribution, leading to potential gains or losses.</p><p class="richtext-p">Participants are responsible for all taxes, fees, and expenses associated with receiving and using rewards, such as gas fees and transaction costs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="related-articles"><div class="related-articles_related-articles__xd25C"><div class="related-articles_grid-wrapper__A28P8 container"><div class="related-articles_headline__CCt8v"><h2 class="heading_heading__zJ45d related-articles_title__ONsUE font-mm-sans type-heading-xxs"><span>Related articles</span><span class="heading_anchor-container__kztuO"><a href="#related-articles" class="heading_anchor__1acN7" aria-label="Direct link to Related articles"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M0 0h24v24H0Zm19 24 5-5v5zm-5.062-12.95h-3.873l-5.068 5.067v2.874h2.874l2.51-2.51 1.414 1.413-3.096 3.095H3v-5.7l6.238-6.238h4.701zM21 8.7l-6.24 6.239h-4.7V12.94h3.874L19 7.872V5h-2.874l-2.51 2.51-1.414-1.413L15.298 3h5.701zM5 0 0 5V0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></span></h2><a class="related-articles_link__FYEcO link_link__Vtfmz font-primary type-label-eyebrow font-weight-medium" style="--link-text-color:var(--color-secondary)" aria-label="All articles" href="/news"><span class="link_label__erP19">All articles</span><span class="link_icon__Yfxoc"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="m5.355 0 4.674 4.675L4.704 10H2.583l4.575-4.575H0v-1.5h7.158L3.233 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="related-articles_grid-col__CIs0w"><ul class="related-articles_items__nhd3Y"><li class="related-articles-item_item__oUSD0"><a class="text-decoration-none" href="/news/introducing-metamask-rewards"><article class="news_news-card__cbSyC news_small__DrDu6"><div class="news_image__Ari_V"><div class="news_tag-holder__Y5niS"><span class="news_tag__bOu36 type-label-caption font-weight-medium">LATEST</span></div><div class="cut-off-corners_cut-off-corners__02pDJ cut-off-corners_top-left__aonBi cut-off-corners_bottom-right__f_aKa cut-off-corners_small__lS0k2 cut-off-corners_step-2__HSnj9"><figure class="image_image-wrapper__TuZgi" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><img alt="Introducing MetaMask Rewards" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="image_image__8Dkn5" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/clixtyxoaeas/2O08JroBPwPYYkbqGAmhNj/3f91e190b732c72ef9860d377946a2b4/Blog_â___Rewards_Launch__1_.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=avif 640w, //images.ctfassets.net/clixtyxoaeas/2O08JroBPwPYYkbqGAmhNj/3f91e190b732c72ef9860d377946a2b4/Blog_â___Rewards_Launch__1_.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=avif 1080w, //images.ctfassets.net/clixtyxoaeas/2O08JroBPwPYYkbqGAmhNj/3f91e190b732c72ef9860d377946a2b4/Blog_â___Rewards_Launch__1_.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=avif 1920w, //images.ctfassets.net/clixtyxoaeas/2O08JroBPwPYYkbqGAmhNj/3f91e190b732c72ef9860d377946a2b4/Blog_â___Rewards_Launch__1_.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=avif 2048w" src="//images.ctfassets.net/clixtyxoaeas/2O08JroBPwPYYkbqGAmhNj/3f91e190b732c72ef9860d377946a2b4/Blog_â___Rewards_Launch__1_.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=avif"/></figure></div></div><div class="news_data__Trd5N"><div class="news_text-block__epKrI"><h3 cl